ment="main" data-pb-style="QN4J5JI"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="G8ODCJJ"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main" data-pb-style="P0X7SRN"><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong id="docs-internal-guid-14e0df9a-7fff-ee6e-c531-d0495822646c">BST Hanoia FW26: S&#7855;c &#273;&#7897; ph&acirc;n t&#7847;ng<br></strong></span></p></div></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="R0NTS39"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="VU8JULO"></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="N3FXC5R"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main" data-pb-style="WNI0D7J"><p id="AB5SNAQ" dir="ltr" style="text-align: center;">M&#7903; &#273;&#7847;u BST FW26, Hanoia t&#7853;p trung khai th&aacute;c b&#7843;ng s&#7855;c th&aacute;i v&agrave; h&igrave;nh d&aacute;ng c&#7911;a thi&ecirc;n nhi&ecirc;n. T&#7915; nh&#7919;ng s&aacute;ng t&#7841;o m&#7899;i &#273;&#7871;n c&aacute;c thi&#7871;t k&#7871; bi&#7875;u t&#432;&#7907;ng, t&#7845;t c&#7843; &#273;&#7873;u &#273;&#432;&#7907;c 'tinh ch&#7881;nh' &#273;&#7875; kho&aacute;c l&ecirc;n m&igrave;nh di&#7879;n m&#7841;o ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n m&#7899;i. &#272;&acirc;y c&#361;ng l&agrave; d&#7883;p Hanoia t&aacute;i ng&#7897; ng&#432;&#7901;i ngh&#7879; s&#297; &#273;&#7891;ng h&agrave;nh th&acirc;n thi&#7871;t, c&ugrave;ng ghi l&#7841;i nh&#7919;ng chuy&#7875;n &#273;&#7897;ng gi&agrave;u n&#259;ng l&#432;&#7907;ng v&agrave; thu tr&#7885;n th&#7847;n th&aacute;i ki&ecirc;u k&#7923; c&#7911;a c&aacute;c lo&agrave;i chim nhi&#7879;t &#273;&#7899;i. Th&ocirc;ng qua nh&#7919;ng &#273;&#432;&#7901;ng n&eacute;t t&#7889;i gi&#7843;n v&agrave; thanh tho&aacute;t, BST kh&#417;i g&#7907;i s&#7921; k&#7871;t n&#7889;i gi&#7919;a t&acirc;m h&#7891;n con ng&#432;&#7901;i v&#7899;i s&#7913;c s&#7889;ng r&#7841;ng r&#7905; c&#7911;a th&#7871; gi&#7899;i t&#7921; nhi&ecirc;n.</p></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="OSWY1B3"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-content-type="row" data-appearance="contained" data-element="main"><div data-enable-parallax="0" data-parallax-speed="0.5" data-background-images="{}" data-background-type="image" data-video-loop="true" data-video-play-only-visible="true" data-video-lazy-load="true" data-video-fallback-src="" data-element="inner" data-pb-style="E77SC1W"><div data-content-type="divider" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><hr data-element="line" data-pb-style="K98MEPK"></div><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><p id="V0604YO" style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong id="docs-internal-guid-7efffee3-7fff-db78-2346-5dfa901ae5f3">Ether</strong></span></span></strong></p></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-group" data-background-images="{}" data-content-type="column-group" data-appearance="default" data-grid-size="12" data-element="main" data-pb-style="LGL98WI"><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="JQFWTBH"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="XKSVQSO"></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="ETTONSX"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><p style="text-align: center;">Trong l&#7847;n h&#7907;p t&aacute;c th&#7913; hai c&ugrave;ng Hanoia, ngh&#7879; s&#297; &#273;i&ecirc;u kh&#7855;c ng&#432;&#7901;i Ph&aacute;p - Sophie Dabet t&#7853;p trung v&agrave;o lo&#7841;t thi&#7871;t k&#7871; mang &#273;&#7853;m h&#417;i th&#7903; thi&ecirc;n nhi&ecirc;n Vi&#7879;t Nam qua b&#7897; ba Ch&agrave;o m&agrave;o, V&#7865;t v&agrave; S&#7867; ng&ocirc;. T&#7915; nh&#7919;ng quan s&aacute;t t&#7881; m&#7881; v&#7873; h&igrave;nh th&#7875; v&agrave; chuy&#7875;n &#273;&#7897;ng, t&aacute;c gi&#7843; ch&#7855;t l&#7885;c &#273;&#7863;c t&iacute;nh c&#7911;a m&#7895;i lo&agrave;i r&#7891;i t&aacute;i sinh ch&uacute;ng d&#432;&#7899;i h&igrave;nh h&agrave;i ngh&#7879; thu&#7853;t.&nbsp;</p></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="SY31B1R"></div></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-group" data-background-images="{}" data-content-type="column-group" data-appearance="default" data-grid-size="12" data-element="main" data-pb-style="GF3UJ8W"><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="TWJ6YXH"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="RECUI2B"><figure data-content-type="image" data-appearance="full-width" data-element="main" data-pb-style="YE03OD7"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-hidden lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/HaNoiA_Vinhome5773_2.JPG" alt="" title="" data-element="desktop_image" data-pb-style="IA4I7SN"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-only lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/HaNoiA_Vinhome5773_2.JPG" alt="" title="" data-element="mobile_image" data-pb-style="DF5GXSS"></figure><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main" data-pb-style="W7Y37IE"><p dir="ltr" style="text-align: center;"><em>Ether l&agrave; k&#7871;t tinh c&#7911;a nh&atilde;n quan tinh t&#7871; v&agrave; s&#7921; ch&#7855;t l&#7885;c ngh&#7879; thu&#7853;t</em></p></div><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><p style="text-align: center;">Khi &#273;&#432;&#7907;c chuy&#7875;n th&#7875; sang ng&ocirc;n ng&#7919; s&#417;n m&agrave;i, tinh th&#7847;n c&#7911;a t&aacute;c ph&#7849;m g&#7889;c v&#7851;n &#273;&#432;&#7907;c gi&#7919; tr&#7885;n v&#7865;n. Hanoia ch&#7881; kh&eacute;o l&eacute;o 'b&#7891;i &#273;&#7855;p' th&ecirc;m c&aacute;c t&#7847;ng s&#7855;c &#273;&#7897; b&#7857;ng k&#7929; thu&#7853;t v&agrave;o m&agrave;u v&agrave; lan m&agrave;u &#273;&#7863;c tr&#432;ng. &#272;&oacute; l&agrave; m&#7897;t cu&#7897;c giao thoa kh&ocirc;ng ch&#7881; &#273;&#7875; t&aacute;i hi&#7879;n, m&agrave; c&ograve;n &#273;&aacute;nh th&#7913;c v&#7867; l&#7897;ng l&#7851;y &#273;&#7863;c tr&#432;ng c&#7911;a nh&#7919;ng c&aacute;nh chim nhi&#7879;t &#273;&#7899;i.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-content-type="products" data-appearance="carousel" data-autoplay="false" data-autoplay-speed="4000" data-infinite-loop="false" data-show-arrows="true" data-show-dots="false" data-carousel-mode="default" data-center-padding="90px" data-element="main