und-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="XOMQU9S"><figure data-content-type="image" data-appearance="full-width" data-element="main" data-pb-style="QA5KEMM"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-hidden lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/Hanoia9161_3.JPG" alt="" title="" data-element="desktop_image" data-pb-style="PWGMVN1"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-only lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/Hanoia9161_3.JPG" alt="" title="" data-element="mobile_image" data-pb-style="TW207HU"></figure></div></div></div><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main" data-pb-style="E7X0RI8"><p dir="ltr" style="text-align: center;"><em>C&aacute;c chi ti&#7871;t v&#7869; tay &#273;&#432;&#7907;c x&#7917; l&yacute; kh&eacute;o l&eacute;o &#273;&#7875; th&#7875; hi&#7879;n r&otilde; &#273;&#7863;c &#273;i&#7875;m ri&ecirc;ng c&#7911;a t&#7915;ng lo&agrave;i chim</em></p></div><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main" data-pb-style="KRCBS8N"><p style="text-align: center;">T&ocirc;n vinh &#273;&#7863;c &#273;i&#7875;m c&#7911;a mu&ocirc;ng th&uacute;, ngh&#7879; thu&#7853;t t&#7841;o h&igrave;nh tr&ecirc;n s&#417;n m&agrave;i &#273;&ograve;i h&#7887;i s&#7921; ki&ecirc;n nh&#7851;n tuy&#7879;t &#273;&#7889;i. T&#7915; m&agrave;u l&ocirc;ng &#273;&#7871;n nh&#7919;ng c&#7917; &#273;&#7897;ng nh&#7887; nh&#7845;t &#273;&#7873;u &#273;&#432;&#7907;c trau chu&#7889;t k&#7929; l&#432;&#7905;ng, &#273;&#7875; d&ugrave; con v&#7853;t &#273;&#7913;ng y&ecirc;n nh&#432;ng v&#7851;n to&aacute;t l&ecirc;n v&#7867; linh &#273;&#7897;ng. Qua s&#7921; quan s&aacute;t tinh t&#432;&#7901;ng c&#7911;a ng&#432;&#7901;i th&#7907; l&agrave;nh ngh&#7873;, th&#7847;n th&aacute;i c&#7911;a con v&#7853;t hi&#7879;n di&#7879;n tr&#7885;n v&#7865;n trong t&#7915;ng &#273;&#432;&#7901;ng n&eacute;t th&#7911; c&ocirc;ng.</p></div><div data-content-type="products" data-appearance="carousel" data-autoplay="false" data-autoplay-speed="4000" data-infinite-loop="false" data-show-arrows="true" data-show-dots="false" data-carousel-mode="default" data-center-padding="90px" data-element="main" data-pb-style="O6LWO53">        <ol class="product-items widget-product-grid" data-role="product-owlCarousel">
