div class="pagebuilder-column-group" data-background-images="{}" data-content-type="column-group" data-appearance="default" data-grid-size="12" data-element="main" data-pb-style="BMUA5FV"><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="LWG3A85"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="PK0T9FC"><figure data-content-type="image" data-appearance="full-width" data-element="main" data-pb-style="SF3NMQ0"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-hidden lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/Hanoia9176.JPG" alt="" title="" data-element="desktop_image" data-pb-style="BAY3Y2C"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-only lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/Hanoia9176.JPG" alt="" title="" data-element="mobile_image" data-pb-style="VYHIA7T"></figure><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main" data-pb-style="BV1LLSY"><p dir="ltr" style="text-align: center;"><em>Elephone mang d&aacute;ng h&igrave;nh quen thu&#7897;c v&#7899;i b&#7843;ng m&agrave;u m&#7899;i v&agrave; k&#7929; thu&#7853;t m&#7899;i</em></p></div></div></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-group" data-background-images="{}" data-content-type="column-group" data-appearance="default" data-grid-size="12" data-element="main" data-pb-style="RKBTNO6"><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="LM5V7YM"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="FJ9UCER"></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="FQE2EVS"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><p id="KFQNQUM" style="text-align: center;">T&#7841;o h&igrave;nh th&ocirc;ng minh c&ugrave;ng s&#7921; k&#7871;t h&#7907;p gi&#7919;a nhi&#7873;u m&#7843;ng m&agrave;u &#273;&atilde; t&#7841;o n&ecirc;n n&eacute;t s&aacute;ng t&#7841;o &#273;&#7897;c &#273;&aacute;o cho d&ograve;ng s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m. &#272;i&#7875;m nh&#7845;n &#273;&#7863;c bi&#7879;t c&#7911;a s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m n&#7857;m &#7903; &#273;&ocirc;i tai &#273;&#432;&#7907;c ch&#7871; t&aacute;c t&#7915; g&#7895; &oacute;c ch&oacute;, c&ugrave;ng ph&#7847;n m&#7855;t &#273;&#432;&#7907;c ch&#7845;m nh&#361; v&agrave;ng l&#7845;p l&aacute;nh, tr&#7903; th&agrave;nh n&eacute;t ch&#7845;m ph&aacute; th&uacute; v&#7883; cho Elephone.</p></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="W876W81"></div></div></div><div data-content-type="products" data-appearance="carousel" data-autoplay="false" data-autoplay-speed="4000" data-infinite-loop="false" data-show-arrows="true" data-show-dots="false" data-carousel-mode="default" data-center-padding="90px" data-element="main" data-pb-style="JDOH9SG">        <ol class="product-items widget-product-grid" data-role="product-owlCarousel">
